<title>2048</title>
<style>
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  body {
    background: #1a1a2e;
    color: #eee;
    font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
